{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20935","headline":"谢秀才有妾缟练改从於人秀才留之不得[後]生感忆座人制诗嘲谢贺复继四首 一 · 李贺","name":"谢秀才有妾缟练改从於人秀才留之不得[後]生感忆座人制诗嘲谢贺复继四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁知泥忆云，望断梨花春。\n荷丝制机练，竹叶剪花裙。\n月明啼阿姊，灯暗会良人。\n也识君夫壻，金鱼挂在身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}